<view class="detail-page">
  <view class="detail-nav">
    <view class="back" bindtap="goBack">‹</view>
    <view class="detail-nav-title">展品详情</view>
    <view class="top-more" bindtap="showActions">•••</view>
  </view>

  <view class="gallery-light">
    <view class="lamp"></view>
    <view class="light-cone"></view>
    <view class="exhibit-number">No. 0021</view>

    <view wx:if="{{type === 'photo'}}" class="photo-exhibit">
      <view class="rope"></view>
      <view class="photo-frame">
        <image src="/assets/art/exhibit-city.jpg" mode="aspectFill"></image>
      </view>
      <view class="description-card">
        <view class="exhibit-title">傍晚的城市</view>
        <view class="exhibit-date">2024.07.21 入藏</view>
        <view class="tiny-ornament">— ◇ —</view>
        <view class="exhibit-description">黄昏将城市温柔地包裹，<br/>灯火初上时，天空像被熔金洒了一层光。</view>
        <view class="hall-link">所属展厅 <text>主馆　›</text></view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{type === 'text'}}" class="text-exhibit">
      <view class="rope"></view>
      <view class="scroll-paper">
        <view class="scroll-title">那些突然照亮我的瞬间</view>
        <view class="tiny-ornament">— ◇ —</view>
        <view class="exhibit-date">2024.07.21 入藏</view>
        <view class="story">
          <text>傍晚从图书馆回家的路上，天空被落日染成了橘红色。</text>
          <text>风很轻，树叶沙沙响，城市好像也慢了下来。</text>
          <text>那一刻突然觉得，平凡的一天也可以这么美。</text>
          <text>原来幸福不是很大的事情，而是这些被忽略的、微小的瞬间。</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{type === 'audio'}}" class="audio-exhibit">
      <view class="gramophone-frame" bindtap="toggleAudio">
        <image src="/assets/art/gramophone.jpg" mode="aspectFill"></image>
        <view class="play-button">{{playing ? 'Ⅱ' : '▶'}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="description-card">
        <view class="exhibit-title">夜里的留言</view>
        <view class="exhibit-date">2024.07.21 入藏</view>
        <view class="tiny-ornament">— ◇ —</view>
        <view class="exhibit-description">这是一段来自心底的声音，<br/>在夜深人静时录下，留给未来的自己。<br/>每一句话，都是当时最真实的心情。</view>
        <view class="hall-link">所属展厅 <text>主馆　›</text></view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="detail-actions">
    <button open-type="share"><view class="action-icon">↗</view><text>分享</text></button>
    <view class="action-button" bindtap="comment"><view class="action-icon">○</view><text>留言 3</text></view>
    <view class="action-button" bindtap="showActions"><view class="action-icon">•••</view><text>更多</text></view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{toast}}" class="toast">{{toast}}</view>
</view>
